 "cues": [
  {
   "id": "1.wake",
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 2.0,
   "text": "In this town, we woke up with the moon,"
  },
  {
   "id": "1.look",
   "start": 2.0,
   "end": 3.6,
   "text": "and nobody was allowed to look at it."
  },
  {
   "id": "2.rule",
   "start": 3.6,
   "end": 5.1667,
   "text": "Nobody knew who had made the rule."
  },
  {
   "id": "2.awake",
   "start": 5.1667,
   "end": 7.1,
   "text": "Nobody knew why we stayed awake all night."
  },
  {
   "id": "2.crows",
   "start": 7.1,
   "end": 9.7,
   "text": "And nobody knew who kept putting scarecrows in our fields."
  },
  {
   "id": "3.hats",
   "start": 9.7,
   "end": 12.0333,
   "text": "Everybody wore a straw hat as wide as a door."
  },
  {
   "id": "3.golem",
   "start": 12.0333,
   "end": 13.5333,
   "text": "Even the iron golem wore one."
  },
  {
   "id": "3.eyes",
   "start": 13.5333,
   "end": 14.9333,
   "text": "We kept our eyes on the ground,"
  },
  {
   "id": "3.bump",
   "start": 14.9333,
   "end": 16.5,
   "text": "and bumped into each other all night."
  },
  {
   "id": "3.lid",
   "start": 16.5,
   "end": 17.8667,
   "text": "The well had a stone lid,"
  },
  {
   "id": "3.water",
   "start": 17.8667,
   "end": 19.6333,
   "text": "so the moon could not get into the water."
  },
  {
   "id": "3.light",
   "start": 19.6333,
   "end": 22.8667,
   "text": "The moonlight never came into town. It stayed out on the wheat,"
  },
  {
   "id": "3.crows",
   "start": 22.8667,
   "end": 23.9333,
   "text": "with the scarecrows."
  },
  {
   "id": "3.forest",
   "start": 23.9333,
   "end": 25.6667,
   "text": "And nothing ever came out of the forest."
  },
  {
   "id": "4.good",
   "start": 25.6667,
   "end": 27.6667,
   "text": "It was a quiet life, and a good one."
  },
  {
   "id": "4.what",
   "start": 27.6667,
   "end": 28.5667,
   "text": "But what was up there?"
  },
  {
   "id": "5.ask",
   "start": 28.5667,
   "end": 30.9333,
   "text": "One evening, I asked the old bell ringer why."
  },
  {
   "id": "5.know",
   "start": 30.9333,
   "end": 32.8667,
   "text": "She said, \"All I know is this:"
  },
  {
   "id": "5.rule",
   "start": 32.8667,
   "end": 34.3,
   "text": "never let it catch you looking.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "5.away",
   "start": 34.3,
   "end": 36.2,
   "text": "Then she lowered her hat and walked away."
  },
  {
   "id": "6.plant",
   "start": 36.2,
   "end": 38.3333,
   "text": "Catch me? How could a moon catch anybody?"
  },
  {
   "id": "6.decide",
   "start": 38.3333,
   "end": 39.4,
   "text": "So I decided to look."
  },
  {
   "id": "7.tip",
   "start": 39.4,
   "end": 41.4667,
   "text": "The very next night, I tipped my hat back."
  },
  {
   "id": "7.edge",
   "start": 41.4667,
   "end": 42.9,
   "text": "I saw one white edge."
  },
  {
   "id": "7.bucket",
   "start": 42.9,
   "end": 45.3667,
   "text": "And the iron golem dropped a bucket over my head."
  },
  {
   "id": "7.week",
   "start": 45.3667,
   "end": 46.4,
   "text": "I wore it for a week."
  },
  {
   "id": "7.knock",
   "start": 46.4,
   "end": 47.4,
   "text": "Everybody knocked on it."
  },
  {
   "id": "8.down",
   "start": 47.4,
   "end": 49.6,
   "text": "But nobody had ever said I could not look down."
  },
  {
   "id": "8.lid",
   "start": 49.6,
   "end": 52.5,
   "text": "So every night, I pushed the lid of the well a little further."
  },
  {
   "id": "8.nobody",
   "start": 52.5,
   "end": 54.6,
   "text": "Nobody saw me. Nobody was ever looking."
  },
  {
   "id": "8.nights",
   "start": 54.6,
   "end": 55.6667,
   "text": "It took thirty nights."
  },
  {
   "id": "9.friend",
   "start": 55.6667,
   "end": 58.2667,
   "text": "On the last night, my best friend was sitting on the lid."
  },
  {
   "id": "9.off",
   "start": 58.2667,
   "end": 59.7,
   "text": "She climbed off without a word,"
  },
  {
   "id": "9.back",
   "start": 59.7,
   "end": 60.5,
   "text": "and turned her back."
  },
  {
   "id": "10.gap",
   "start": 60.5,
   "end": 62.7667,
   "text": "The gap was just wide enough for a moon."
  },
  {
   "id": "10.town",
   "start": 62.7667,
   "end": 65.7,
   "text": "Behind me: hats, lanterns, open doors."
  },
  {
   "id": "10.nobody",
   "start": 65.7,
   "end": 66.6667,
   "text": "Nobody looked up."
  },
  {
   "id": "10.hat",
   "start": 66.6667,
   "end": 67.6333,
   "text": "I took off my hat,"
  },
  {
   "id": "10.stone",
   "start": 67.6333,
   "end": 69.0,
   "text": "put my hands on the cold stone,"
  },
  {
   "id": "10.lean",
   "start": 69.0,
   "end": 69.8667,
   "text": "and leaned over."
  },
  {
   "id": "11.moon",
   "start": 69.8667,
   "end": 73.0,
   "text": "For a second, it was only a moon, shaking a little in the water."
  },
  {
   "id": "11.blink",
   "start": 73.0,
   "end": 73.7667,
   "text": "Then it blinked."
  },
  {
   "id": "11.eye",
   "start": 73.7667,
   "end": 74.7333,
   "text": "It was an eye."
  },
  {
   "id": "11.caught",
   "start": 74.7333,
   "end": 76.8667,
   "text": "It rolled, slowly, and caught me looking."
  },
  {
   "id": "11.up",
   "start": 76.8667,
   "end": 78.5,
   "text": "I looked up. I could not help it."
  },
  {
   "id": "11.ground",
   "start": 78.5,
   "end": 80.1667,
   "text": "In a town that only looked at the ground,"
  },
  {
   "id": "11.seen",
   "start": 80.1667,
   "end": 82.1333,
   "text": "something was finally looking at me."
  },
  {
   "id": "11.light",
   "start": 82.1333,
   "end": 84.6667,
   "text": "And for the first time, the moonlight came into town."
  },
  {
   "id": "12.stay",
   "start": 84.6667,
   "end": 86.3333,
   "text": "I could have stood in that light all night,"
  },
  {
   "id": "12.dark",
   "start": 86.3333,
   "end": 88.4667,
   "text": "if the dark wheat behind me had not begun to move."
  },
  {
   "id": "12.walk",
   "start": 88.4667,
   "end": 89.8333,
   "text": "The scarecrows were walking."
  },
  {
   "id": "13.never",
   "start": 89.8333,
   "end": 90.9,
   "text": "Nobody had put them there."
  },
  {
   "id": "13.blink",
   "start": 90.9,
   "end": 93.1667,
   "text": "They had walked out of the forest, one blink at a time."
  },
  {
   "id": "13.held",
   "start": 93.1667,
   "end": 95.8667,
   "text": "The moon had been holding them still, just by staring."
  },
  {
   "id": "13.awake",
   "start": 95.8667,
   "end": 97.7,
   "text": "We stayed awake in case it ever looked away."
  },
  {
   "id": "13.hat",
   "start": 97.7,
   "end": 99.0,
   "text": "I pulled my hat over my face"
  },
  {
   "id": "13.bored",
   "start": 99.0,
   "end": 100.6,
   "text": "and waited for the moon to get bored."
  },
  {
   "id": "13.back",
   "start": 100.6,
   "end": 102.5667,
   "text": "When the light went back to the wheat, they stopped."
  },
  {
   "id": "13.closer",
   "start": 102.5667,
   "end": 103.9,
   "text": "They were just a lot closer."
  },
  {
   "id": "14.knows",
   "start": 103.9,
   "end": 105.0333,
   "text": "But it knows me now."
  },
  {
   "id": "14.blinks",
   "start": 105.0333,
   "end": 107.1,
   "text": "Every night, it finds my house and blinks."
  },
  {
   "id": "14.step",
   "start": 107.1,
   "end": 109.6333,
   "text": "And every night, they are one step closer to my door."
  },
  {
   "id": "14.sub",
   "start": 109.6333,
   "end": 111.7,
   "text": "Subscribe before it blinks again."
  }
 ],
